  "description": "Use when setting up, designing, writing, or repairing tests and test harnesses in a Meteor 3 app. Triggers on meteortesting:mocha, --driver-package, TEST_WATCH, TEST_BROWSER_DRIVER, MOCHA_GREP, meteor.testModule, focused tests, .only, Meteor.server.method_handlers, Meteor.server.publish_handlers, DDP.connect, --full-app integration mode, sinon, async test signatures, Playwright/Cypress E2E. Use this skill when the user asks about test runners, asks about testing publications, or asks about Jest vs Mocha in Meteor. For a failing, hanging, or flaky test whose failing layer or root cause is unknown, use meteor-debugging before changing the test or app.",
